{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj44cg3HU4Qinrc84ext","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient oak door stands before you, weathered and imposing. Iron bands cross its surface in patterns older than memory. A single keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\nYou have presented: **a key.**\n\n*The keyhole examines your offering...*\n\n*A deep resonance thrums through the wood. The iron bands shudder. Dust falls from the lintel like forgotten years releasing their grip.*\n\n*With a sound like a held breath finally exhaled—*\n\n##**C L I C K.**\n\n*The door swings inward, slowly, revealing a darkness that breathes warm air across your face. It smells of rain on stone, of pages unturned, of the space between one heartbeat and the next.*\n\n*Beyond the threshold, a single path of pale light stretches forward into the unknown.*\n\n**The door is open.**\n\n*You may pass.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":198,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}